                <pb facs="0322" n="292" xml:id="pg292"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>At this time there were before the Fourth Committee other questions regarding
                    non-self-governing territories, apart from the issue of transmission of
                    information under Article 73(<hi rendition="#italic">e</hi>), that were of
                    interest to the United States. These are described briefly in the document that
                    follows, with particular reference to the position taken upon them by the United
                    States.</p>
            </div>
